    <Element Type="Comment" Id="D040B636">
        <Comment>
            The drop pod action returns when the FX are all cleaned up, we don&apos;t want to wait that long.  But if we return before the units are made visible, the AI
            can&apos;t use them for the attack.  So we just wait for that condition.
        </Comment>
    </Element>
