    <Element Type="Comment" Id="A012440D">
        <Comment>
            Set the dummy&apos;s energy to what the active hero&apos;s was at the time of death/cleanup, and set the Top Bar Energy Bar for the active hero unit back to the dummy.
            If the hero died, set the shield and energy regen rates of the dummies to 0 for the duration of the death cooldown.
        </Comment>
    </Element>
