    <Element Type="Comment" Id="252713BA">
        <Comment>
            This trigger queues up the different charges for the active ability as the player targets them.  If the player has
            consumed the maximum number of charges it also triggers the targeting UI deactivation trigger by removing
            the activated behavior for the active ability from the caster unit.
            The first part of the following If/Then/Else runs for directional abilities such as Thermal Lance and Strafe.  The
            second part runs for all of the non-directional abilities such as Orbital Strike and Graviton Bombs.
        </Comment>
    </Element>
