    <Element Type="Comment" Id="CB41A755">
        <Comment>
            Template Version 1.11
            1.11 - Removed Music Scripting, this is handled by the Commanders now. Updated Victory &amp; Defeat. 
            1.10 - Added intro zoom in
            1.09 - Initialization restructure.  Removed unneeded sections.  Touched up victory &amp; defeat.
            1.08 - Added Example AI Waves
            1.07 - Coop AI updates
            1.06 - Initial co-op changes
            1.05 - Added Midway Scripted Event &amp; autosave
            1.04 - Replaced Temp Cinematic Transmission lines
            1.03 - Removed Transmissions folder, integrated Transmissions with example Scripted Event
            1.02 - Moved Transmissions folder in Main, added &quot;First Scripted Event&quot; example trigger
            1.01 - Moving Objective Complete/Fail out of the Action Queue
        </Comment>
    </Element>
