    <Element Type="Comment" Id="BF304C60">
        <Comment>
            If the action queue has something in it, the player&apos;s attention is probably directed elsewhere, so we hold off.
            We don&apos;t just queue it because it might no longer be relevant (perhaps it already killed your units, perhaps you killed it, etc.)
            In that case, we just wait until the next time we run into this situation and we (hopefully) have a spare moment to teach you.
        </Comment>
    </Element>
