    </Element>
    <Element Type="Comment" Id="42544ED4">
        <Comment>
            We check for TransmissionCurrentType to fix a bug where this can be called in the same loop that a transmission trigger ends at the end of a mission. Thus the above check fails, and it waits forever for the below TransmissionCount which never updates again.
        </Comment>
