    <Element Type="Comment" Id="FDC66B51">
        <Comment>
            When unit events refer to a unit variable, this option determines how empty values are treated. 
            By default, empty unit variables are considered &quot;any unit&quot;, and the event will fire for all units. 
            This can be changed to &quot;no unit&quot;, and the event will never fire if the variable is empty.
        </Comment>
    </Element>
